/-!
# Free and evaluation functors for sequential spectra

This file specializes the generic free-at-object/evaluation adjunction for
Day modules to sequential spectra. It also computes the levels of a free
sequential spectrum and their action on maps.
-/

@[expose] public section

set_option autoImplicit false

noncomputable section

universe vC uC

open CategoryTheory Limits MonoidalCategory
open scoped ExternalProduct MonoidalCategory MonObj MonoidalLeftAction

namespace CategoryTheory.SequentialSpectrum

